# p_census_peak_x4: diagnostic. Owner census at the true peak (PEAK_TRIGGER_PCT=0) of the streaming
# driver (bert_perlayer_stream_cpu.py, x4's script) with x2's six levers. Rationale as p_census_peak_x2
